I've been digging around in the various info files, and have found
listings for the weights of different equipment and armour.  One question
though:  

There's no comment given on how much a given amount of gold will
weigh you down, and I've held a couple thousand gold pieces without it
seeming to add to my encumbrance.  But, if I wish for say, 500000 gold (in
Wizard mode), it'll be too heavy to carry.  How exactly is gold
encumbrance handled?

Also, Dev Team:  It sure would be nice if there were also a stat given for
how much weight your character is currently carrying (the same way it
shows how many hit points you have left).  That way, you'd know how heavy
a particular object was, and could decide whether to keep it.  Without
having seen the FAQ, I'd never have known that an oil lamp weighed more
than a sword!


